*.cdt
# the root-level linked CPC binary written by `zcc -create-app -o game`
/game
# B7 step 9.5: the link-time memory map is a per-build staged artifact.
# z88dk's crt_section.inc hard-codes INCLUDE "./mmap.inc" (fixed, cwd-relative)
# when __MMAP=-1, so each platform stages its OWN tracked source map
# (mmap-zx.inc / mmap-cpc-banked.inc) to this transient ./mmap.inc right before
# the main link.  It is never a tracked file, so an interrupted build cannot
# corrupt a committed map (the bug that motivated splitting the ZX/CPC maps).
/mmap.inc
# B7 step 9.2c: cpc-banked banking-build artifacts at repo root
/GAME.BIN
/LOADER.BIN
/BANK*.BIN
/game.com
/loader_cpc
/loader_cpc.*
# B7 step 10 z88dk-banking redesign: appmake-emitted AMSDOS bank disc files
# (GAME.B<n> -> root-level game.b<n>) at repo root.  The linker per-section bank
# binaries (game_BANK_<n>.bin) are already covered by the global *.bin above.
/*.b[0-7]
# scratch screenshots from tools/cap32-shot.sh / emulator dumps
/shot.png
screenshot_*.png
cbt-*.png

.claude/worktrees

# Phase T0 CPC spike: keep the .cpc/.dsk/.bin deliverables under
# misc/cpc-spike/ in-tree so the gating phase has visible artifacts.
# This whole directory is deleted before Phase T1.
!misc/cpc-spike/*.bin
!misc/cpc-spike/*.cpc
!misc/cpc-spike/*.dsk
